      "full_page": "Fr. Robert's Lenten Sermons 1908 God the Creator 1. \"The fool hath said in his heart there is no God Psalm XIII, 1 2. I am the Way -T. - L. John XIV, 6. 3. He was wounded for our iniquities. He was bruised for our sins. The chas- tisment of our peace was laid upon Him and by His wounds we are healed. And you when you were dead in your sins, He hath quickened, blotting out the hand- writing of the decree which was against us, fastening to the Cross. 4. \"Whose sins you shall forgive They are forgiven them.\" John XXI 5. \"He that eateth my flesh and drinketh my blood hath everlasting life, and I will raise him up at the last day.\" John VI, 55.",
